      "id": "task-3",
      "subagent": "general",
      "description": "Test ACP delegation end-to-end",
      "dependencies": ["task-2"],
      "prompt": {
        "template": `## Task: Test ACP Delegation End-to-End

Verify that acp_delegate works from host to all DevBob containers.

### Test Script

\`\`\`typescript
// Test 1: Basic connectivity to all containers
const containers = [
  { name: "devbob-rpc-api", port: 3001 },
  { name: "devbob-dashboard", port: 3002 },
  { name: "devbob-cli", port: 3003 },
  { name: "devbob-opencode", port: 3004 }
];

for (const container of containers) {
  console.log(\`Testing \${container.name}...\`);
  
  // Test 1: HTTP endpoint
  const response = await fetch(\`http://localhost:\${container.port}/acp/sessions\`);
  console.log(\`  HTTP: \${response.ok ? '✓' : '✗'}\`);
  
  // Test 2: acp_delegate
  const result = await acp_delegate({
    target: \`docker://\${container.name}\`,
    taskDescription: "Test connectivity",
    prompt: "Run: ls -la /workspace && git status",
    timeout: 60
  });
  console.log(\`  Delegation: \${result.success ? '✓' : '✗'}\`);
}
\`\`\`

### Expected Results
All containers should:
- ✓ Return HTTP 200 on /acp/sessions
- ✓ Accept acp_delegate calls
- ✓ Return successful responses

### Document Working Pattern
Create example commands for future reference.`,
